====== D-Link DIR-860L B1 ======


{{:media:dlink:dir-860l_rev_b1.png?250|}} {{:media:dlink:dir-860l_rev_b1_back.png?200|}}

The D-Link DIR-860L router is a 2.4GHz and 5 GHz router with 5 gigabit ports.
It has an 880 MHz processor, with 16 MBytes of Flash and 128 MBytes of RAM,
WiFi AC and one USB 3.0 port.

There are two known versions of this router, H/W rev A1 and B1. \\
Hardware revision **A1** is based on Broadcom BCM47081A0 and is **not supported**. \\
Hardware revision **B1** is however based on Mediatek MT7621AT and is **supported**. 

